text:
Here is a schema. Produce three realistic sample records that satisfy it, as a JSON array.

{
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["sku", "title", "price_cents", "in_stock", "dimensions_cm"],
  "properties": {
    "sku": {"type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Z]{3}-[0-9]{5}$"},
    "title": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 60},
    "price_cents": {"type": "integer", "minimum": 0},
    "in_stock": {"type": "boolean"},
    "dimensions_cm": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {"w": {"type": "number"}, "h": {"type": "number"}, "d": {"type": "number"}},
      "required": ["w", "h", "d"]
    }
  }
}
